urchased  together for 29.99 the two film  collection seems to be another mixed  message for DC fans however some of whom  had previously tempted to get James Gunn  fired after the director promised a new  younger man of steel for his upcoming  self-penned Superman film unsurprisingly  fan reception towards the Black Adam and  Man of Steel bundle has been mixed one  where this user wrote this is just  disrespectful others found the  collection's existence funny with one  user saying this is as close to the real  thing that Dwayne Johnson's ever gonna  get while The Logical option would have  been bundling Black Adam in 2019 Shazam  instead it's easy to see why Warner  Brothers released this collection the  marketing for Black Adam largely rested  on the return of Cavill so it makes  sense that DC wanted to celebrate the  digital release of Johnson's flick by  bundling it with Superman's ultimately  the bundle is simply a matter of poor  timing meanwhile James Gunn and Peter  saffron have largely remained  tight-lived regarding their plans for DC  what DC fans do know is that the  upcoming Superman Project won't be an  origin story with gun confirming the  news on Twitter the new DC boss also  made it clear that Warner Brothers will  be moved moving forward with the release  of movies currently in production such  as Blue Beetle and Aquaman the lost  kingdom reports have also emerged that  the flash will kickstarter's marketing  campaign with a TV spot during the 2023  Super Bowl the status of other  steiniverse characters is currently  unknown however which only makes Warner  Brothers new home release bundle or the  more puzzling still maybe the two film  collection could be seen as a respectful  farewell to two Titans of a franchise  neither of whom is expected to return at  least not anytime soon  foreign
 

